      "value": "I'm sorry, but if you use your email as your username then that's on you =/\nThe email (from the email field) is hidden and only visible to you and staff.\nIf you used your email as your \"username\", then maybe try contact the VRChat via a support ticket to see what they can help with. \nhttps://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new",
