  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently if you use your email as a username and someone goes to your profile on the website they see your Email Address. The same happens if you have a username instead. This is a huge security flaw for individuals as all it takes is a google search and they may potentially be doxed or lead to a password dump that could lead them to being hacked on far more important platforms.",
